<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103861" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τηνῐκάδε</span></b> , Adv.
		= foreg., answering to a Relat., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>at this time, then</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεὶ . . , τ. . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					16.11.6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπειδὴ . . , τὸ τ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				16.30.7
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				66.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				74.38
			</span></i>; also after <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρῶν</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεὶ ἑώρα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.28.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs., <i>at
				this time of day, so early</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ
				ἕνεκα τ. ἀφίκου</span>; <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cri.</u>
				43a
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Prt.</u>
				310b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὔριον τ</span>. to-morrow
				<i>at this time</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				76b
			</span></i>: c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. τῆς ὥρας, τοῦ
			καιροῦ</span>, <i>at this season</i> of the year, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				1.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.27
			</span></i>.</div>
